00:02:30.510 --> 00:02:35.510
<b>Ep.25</b>

00:02:30.510 --> 00:02:35.510
<b>Ep.25</b>

00:02:30.510 --> 00:02:35.510
<b>The Great Onmyoji, Asakura Hao</b>

00:02:30.510 --> 00:02:35.510
<b>The Great Onmyoji, Asakura Hao</b>

00:02:36.360 --> 00:02:37.360
<b>No way!</b>

00:02:37.940 --> 00:02:40.610
<b>Even after that explosion,
Spirit of Fire is…</b>

00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:43.240
<b>He hasn't burned out at all!</b>

00:02:44.620 --> 00:02:45.580
<b>No…</b>

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:49.210
<b>That isn't Spirit of Fire.</b>

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:51.710
<b>Water!</b>

00:02:51.790 --> 00:02:53.540
<b>Spirit of Fire</b>

00:02:53.630 --> 00:02:55.340
<b>has turned into water!</b>

00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:57.420
<b>What is going on?</b>

00:02:57.510 --> 00:02:59.470
<b>I have no idea!</b>

00:02:59.550 --> 00:03:01.220
<b><i>Suikokuka.</i></b>

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:02.970
<b>What?</b>

00:03:03.050 --> 00:03:04.100
<b><i>Suikokuka.</i></b>

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:06.260
<b>Water extinguishes Fire.</b>

00:03:06.350 --> 00:03:08.430
<b>Therefore Water conquers Fire.</b>

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:10.140
<b><i>Accordingly,</i></b>

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:12.770
<b><i>he changed Fire to Water
and protected himself.</i></b>

00:03:14.520 --> 00:03:15.770
<b>That's all.</b>

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:17.320
<b>Fire to Water?</b>

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:18.820
<b><i>Kashodo.</i></b>

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:20.640
<b>Kashodo</b>

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:20.640
<b>Kashodo</b>

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:20.820
<b>Fire creates Earth.</b>

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:23.640
<b>Doshogun</b>

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:23.640
<b>Doshogun</b>

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:23.780
<b><i>Doshogon</i>. Earth creates Metal.</b>

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:26.890
<b>Goshosui</b>

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:26.890
<b>Goshosui</b>

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:26.830
<b><i>Gonshosui.</i> Metal creates Water.</b>

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:29.950
<b>These are the laws of nature.</b>

00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:33.920
<b>These laws of nature are expressed</b>

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:36.710
<b>by his symbol, the pentagram.</b>

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:39.340
<b><i>It symbolizes the relationship</i></b>

00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:43.970
<b><i>between Wood, Fire,
Earth, Metal, and Water,</i></b>

00:03:44.050 --> 00:03:46.050
<b><i>the five elements
that make up this planet.</i></b>

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:49.600
<b>-The relationship between the elements?
-Yes.</b>

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:53.810
<b><i>The first relationship
is that of mutual overcoming,</i></b>

00:03:49.680 --> 00:04:04.430
<b>Five rows of aisei</b>

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:57.230
<b><i>which represents how the elements
behave when in conflict.</i></b>

00:03:57.320 --> 00:04:00.070
<b><i>The second is the relationship
of mutual generation.</i></b>

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:03.950
<b><i>This is the cycle in which the elements
create each other.</i></b>

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:07.950
<b>Those with perfect knowledge
of the five elements</b>

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:10.080
<b>can decipher all of nature's secrets</b>

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:12.120
<b>and manipulate and change the elements</b>

00:04:12.210 --> 00:04:14.290
<b>as they see fit.</b>

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:16.670
<b>And that</b>

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:18.130
<b>is the power</b>

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:21.010
<b><i>that the Great Onmyoji,
Asakura Hao, commands.</i></b>

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:24.840
<b>"The Great Onmyoji, Asakura Hao"?</b>

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:24.840
<b>"The Great Onmyoji, Asakura Hao"?</b>

00:04:33.180 --> 00:04:35.650
<b>Wait a second! Asakura?</b>

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:38.230
<b>What the hell does that mean?</b>

00:04:39.820 --> 00:04:44.200
<b>You knew who he was this whole time
and didn't think to tell us?</b>

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:48.620
<b>I only found out myself
during our latest training.</b>

00:04:49.410 --> 00:04:51.740
<b>I thought you'd been acting strange!</b>

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:54.250
<b>Like the weight of the world was on you!</b>

00:04:55.870 --> 00:04:56.710
<b>Tell me!</b>

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:58.920
<b>What's he got to do with you?</b>

00:05:00.130 --> 00:05:02.170
<b>I wasn't keeping quiet</b>

00:05:02.710 --> 00:05:04.670
<b>because I wasn't hiding anything.</b>

00:05:05.510 --> 00:05:06.630
<b>It was because</b>

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:10.100
<b>if I tell you this, you'll be dragged
into the Asakuras' fight.</b>

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:12.430
<b>But…</b>

00:05:13.810 --> 00:05:15.770
<b>I can't hide how I feel any longer.</b>

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:18.190
<b>He's my…</b>

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:22.280
<b>He's just an ancestor.</b>

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:23.280
<b>"Just"?</b>

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:25.820
<b>From 1,000 years ago, I should add.</b>

00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:28.320
<b>But if you stick your nose in any further,</b>

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:31.450
<b>everyone will suffer for it, Horohoro.</b>

00:05:31.530 --> 00:05:33.580
<b>Who cares?</b>

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:36.500
<b>Yoh's my friend!
I can't just stay out of all this!</b>

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:39.920
<b>All the more reason
to leave this all to Yoh.</b>

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:44.130
<b>He has to end this himself.</b>

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:46.970
<b>You're telling me
you're okay with this then?</b>

00:05:47.050 --> 00:05:48.130
<b>Of course I am.</b>

00:05:48.220 --> 00:05:52.220
<b>He's already said more than enough
for me to put the pieces together.</b>

00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:53.510
<b>The pieces?</b>

00:05:54.770 --> 00:05:56.430
<b>I finally understand.</b>

00:05:56.980 --> 00:06:00.560
<b>If he's an Onmyoji from 1000 years ago,</b>

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:04.530
<b><i>then the person Lilirara
showed us from 500 years ago</i></b>

00:06:05.030 --> 00:06:07.200
<b><i>must have been Hao after all.</i></b>

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:08.450
<b>What?</b>

00:06:09.110 --> 00:06:10.990
<b>For him,</b>

00:06:11.070 --> 00:06:12.950
<b>it's been a 1000-year journey of the soul,</b>

00:06:13.030 --> 00:06:14.950
<b>reincarnating back into this world</b>

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:18.920
<b>to attain the strongest Spirit Allies
and become the Shaman King!</b>

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:21.170
<b><i>500 years ago,</i></b>

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:25.050
<b><i>Hao reincarnated as a member
of the Patch Tribe to get Spirit of Fire,</i></b>

00:06:25.130 --> 00:06:27.590
<b><i>which, combined with his own Onmyojutsu,</i></b>

00:06:27.670 --> 00:06:30.760
<b><i>provided him with the ultimate Over Soul.</i></b>

00:06:32.050 --> 00:06:34.260
<b>Such dreadful power.</b>

00:06:34.350 --> 00:06:36.770
<b>How can such a thing be permitted?</b>

00:06:37.350 --> 00:06:40.230
<b>Ms. Maiden.
This is the worst-case scenario possible.</b>

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:42.730
<b>There's a strong possibility</b>

00:06:42.810 --> 00:06:45.900
<b>that no attacks of any kind
will work against his Over Soul.</b>

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:47.740
<b>That's enough, Pofe.</b>

00:06:48.610 --> 00:06:51.160
<b>Are you just going
to give up all hope now?</b>

00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:54.370
<b>Now that we've learned
so much of his secret,</b>

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:57.950
<b>shouldn't we be planning our next move,
no matter how dire the situation?</b>

00:06:59.160 --> 00:07:04.170
<b>X-III died so that justice may be done.
I won't allow their deaths to be in vain!</b>

00:07:05.130 --> 00:07:05.960
<b>Marco…</b>

00:07:07.090 --> 00:07:08.920
<b>Well, I'll be damned.</b>

00:07:09.010 --> 00:07:12.180
<b>I didn't anticipate
that you'd force me to do this.</b>

00:07:13.390 --> 00:07:14.260
<b>Here's your prize.</b>

00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:19.850
<b>I'm not just going to let you die.</b>

00:07:21.390 --> 00:07:22.650
<b>Those are…</b>

00:07:23.230 --> 00:07:26.440
<b>Meene, Kevin, and Venstar's souls!</b>

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:29.110
<b>Not all souls are made equal.</b>

00:07:29.650 --> 00:07:31.610
<b>Good or evil,</b>

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:35.120
<b>strong-willed souls radiate light</b>

00:07:35.200 --> 00:07:37.700
<b>and are a source of great power.</b>

00:07:38.790 --> 00:07:39.870
<b>X-III.</b>

00:07:40.410 --> 00:07:44.960
<b>Your actions seemed
nothing more than foolish to me,</b>

00:07:45.040 --> 00:07:48.000
<b>but you were ready to lay down your lives,</b>

00:07:48.090 --> 00:07:51.380
<b>and I recognize
the tremendous willpower of your souls.</b>

00:07:52.050 --> 00:07:56.550
<b>I could never let
such excellent souls go to waste.</b>

00:07:57.220 --> 00:08:01.390
<b>Become my sustenance
and live on for all eternity.</b>

00:08:03.690 --> 00:08:04.900
<b>You're eating well today.</b>

00:08:05.480 --> 00:08:06.690
<b>Go ahead,</b>

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:08.650
<b>Spirit of Fire.</b>

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:15.140
<b>MATCHES ARE POSTPONED
WHILE THE STAGE IS BEING REPAIRED{needs moccha}</b>

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:18.980
<b>Matches are postponed
While the stage is being repaired{needs moccha}</b>

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:18.490
<b>An Over Soul that grows stronger
by devouring souls…</b>

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:21.290
<b>I don't want to believe it's true.</b>

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:23.750
<b>To think that before Hao took it,</b>

00:08:23.830 --> 00:08:26.790
<b>it was one of our Patch Tribe's
Five Grand Elemental Spirits…</b>

00:08:29.590 --> 00:08:33.970
<b><i>The Five Grand Elemental Spirits
are great nature spirits formed by souls</i></b>

00:08:34.050 --> 00:08:36.390
<b><i>that were once part of the Great Spirit</i></b>

00:08:36.470 --> 00:08:39.350
<b><i>extracting their own unique traits.</i></b>

00:08:39.930 --> 00:08:41.930
<b>In other words, Spirit of Fire</b>

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:46.310
<b>is the most powerful fire spirit
born from the Great Spirit,</b>

00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:49.730
<b>adding to its power
with every soul it absorbs.</b>

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:55.320
<b>What's truly fearsome is Hao's Onmyojutsu,
as it allows him to change their nature.</b>

00:08:55.860 --> 00:08:58.910
<b>The sum of Western knowledge
could never have realized</b>

00:08:58.990 --> 00:09:00.830
<b>such an extraordinary power as that.</b>

00:09:00.910 --> 00:09:02.830
<b>He's truly invincible.</b>

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:07.790
<b>So at this rate, he's going to get
stronger with every match?</b>

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:13.130
<b>Our duty is to carry out the Shaman Fight.</b>

00:09:13.710 --> 00:09:16.930
<b>We must not allow ourselves
to get any strange ideas.</b>

00:09:19.010 --> 00:09:20.140
<b><i>Is it ready?</i></b>

00:09:20.220 --> 00:09:22.470
<b>You bet, Silva.</b>

00:09:22.970 --> 00:09:24.980
<b>Made with traditional Patch techniques,</b>

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:27.560
<b>the ultra-rare Hao's Techniques Video.</b>

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:32.820
<b>It got every little move he made,
up close without him even knowing it.</b>

00:09:33.360 --> 00:09:34.820
<b>I owe you one, Radim.</b>

00:09:34.900 --> 00:09:36.740
<b>Wait! I'm not giving you this.</b>

00:09:36.820 --> 00:09:37.740
<b>What?</b>

00:09:38.490 --> 00:09:40.910
<b>As your friend, let me just say this.</b>

00:09:41.530 --> 00:09:42.830
<b>He's too dangerous.</b>

00:09:43.740 --> 00:09:45.200
<b>Don't get any more involved.</b>

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:48.920
<b>You're a good guy.</b>

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:51.920
<b>Sorry.</b>

00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:54.510
<b>All the same, I can't step back from this.</b>

00:09:54.590 --> 00:09:55.840
<b>Silva!</b>

00:09:56.420 --> 00:10:00.760
<b>Half a millennium ago,
a Patch man committed a heinous atrocity.</b>

00:10:00.850 --> 00:10:01.680
<b>Hao.</b>

00:10:02.850 --> 00:10:05.060
<b>His blood runs through my veins.</b>

00:10:05.560 --> 00:10:08.640
<b>Which is why my soul
is duty-bound to stop him!</b>

00:10:12.270 --> 00:10:14.400
<b>That damn traitor.</b>

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:17.780
<b>We need to report this at once.</b>

00:10:18.900 --> 00:10:21.770
<b>RESTAURANT</b>

00:10:18.900 --> 00:10:21.770
<b>RAMEN CURRY</b>

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:21.700
<b><i>I don't like this wind.</i></b>

00:10:21.770 --> 00:10:24.100
<b>RESTAURANT</b>

00:10:21.770 --> 00:10:26.980
<b>RAMEN CURRY</b>

00:10:22.410 --> 00:10:25.830
<b>The whole damn island is swamped
in this damp, oppressive air.</b>

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:28.500
<b>Well?</b>

00:10:28.580 --> 00:10:30.250
<b>Feeling any better?</b>

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:31.920
<b>I guess.</b>

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:34.590
<b>What does it matter how I feel, though?</b>

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:38.380
<b>Yoh had to deal
with much worse stuff than I have.</b>

00:10:39.300 --> 00:10:43.300
<b>I guess no matter how strong they get,
people are still people.</b>

00:10:44.220 --> 00:10:45.100
<b>Manta…</b>

00:10:46.390 --> 00:10:48.230
<b>It's no good. Nothing's biting.</b>

00:10:48.310 --> 00:10:49.310
<b>So laid-back!</b>

00:10:49.390 --> 00:10:51.730
<b>Oh, finally feeling better, are you?</b>

00:10:51.810 --> 00:10:55.650
<b>Why, of all times,
are you casually fishing now?</b>

00:10:55.730 --> 00:11:00.030
<b>Well, maybe times like this are
the best to fish and calm yourself down.</b>

00:11:00.110 --> 00:11:02.280
<b>Man, you never cease to amaze me.</b>

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:05.740
<b>You recovered faster
than any of us? I'm speechless.</b>

00:11:05.830 --> 00:11:06.990
<b>What?</b>

00:11:08.250 --> 00:11:09.580
<b>Lucky me, huh?</b>

00:11:12.120 --> 00:11:15.630
<b>This cycle will probably
keep repeating for a long time.</b>

00:11:16.590 --> 00:11:18.510
<b>Feeling happy, then sad…</b>

00:11:19.090 --> 00:11:20.760
<b>Having confidence, then losing it…</b>

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:25.100
<b>I know that if I can just overcome it,
I can get stronger,</b>

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:27.430
<b>but for some reason, I hold it all in.</b>

00:11:29.180 --> 00:11:32.600
<b>But then unbottling those feelings
is surprisingly refreshing.</b>

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:36.110
<b>Maybe it's times like that</b>

00:11:36.690 --> 00:11:38.980
<b>are what friends are for.</b>

00:11:41.740 --> 00:11:42.700
<b>There you go…</b>

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:44.820
<b>Yoh…</b>

00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:48.490
<b>Which is why I need to talk to you guys.</b>

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:51.040
<b>About me and him.</b>

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:55.330
<b>After his 1000-year journey,</b>

00:11:56.090 --> 00:11:58.750
<b>he made his return to the world
through the Asakura Family.</b>

00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:02.880
<b>He's…</b>

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:05.220
<b><i>my big brother.</i></b>

00:12:08.970 --> 00:12:13.960
GABRIEL

00:12:08.970 --> 00:12:13.960
RAMIEL

00:12:21.490 --> 00:12:22.700
<b>Yoh…</b>

00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:25.740
<b>Don't worry.</b>

00:12:26.320 --> 00:12:29.120
<b>I didn't mean to startle you.</b>

00:12:30.870 --> 00:12:31.790
<b>I'm happy.</b>

00:12:32.790 --> 00:12:34.250
<b>You finally opened up to us.</b>

00:12:34.870 --> 00:12:38.460
<b>But you can't tell us
not to worry about this.</b>

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:42.720
<b>Hey, I finally managed to tell you.</b>

00:12:42.800 --> 00:12:44.720
<b>So don't worry about it.</b>

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:46.970
<b>Yoh!</b>

00:12:48.720 --> 00:12:50.390
<b>His face…</b>

00:12:50.470 --> 00:12:51.970
<b>His behavior…</b>

00:12:52.680 --> 00:12:53.890
<b>If anything,</b>

00:12:53.980 --> 00:12:56.980
<b>it would be stranger to learn
he had nothing to do with you.</b>

00:12:58.190 --> 00:13:00.520
<b>You're serious, aren't you, Yoh?</b>

00:13:01.280 --> 00:13:03.650
<b>Yeah. Super serious.</b>

00:13:04.860 --> 00:13:06.160
<b>No…</b>

00:13:06.240 --> 00:13:07.660
<b><i>You're telling me that Yoh</i></b>

00:13:07.740 --> 00:13:10.160
<b><i>is Hao's brother?</i></b>

00:13:11.120 --> 00:13:12.240
<b>Why?</b>

00:13:16.250 --> 00:13:17.710
<b>Watch where you're going.</b>

00:13:18.290 --> 00:13:20.840
<b>We'll have problems
if you're not more careful, Manta.</b>

00:13:20.920 --> 00:13:21.750
<b>Anna.</b>

00:13:22.510 --> 00:13:25.090
<b>It's worse than that! Yoh is…</b>

00:13:25.670 --> 00:13:26.590
<b>I know.</b>

00:13:26.680 --> 00:13:29.720
<b>Did you think
there was something that I didn't know?</b>

00:13:29.800 --> 00:13:32.560
<b>But I can't believe
that monster is Yoh's brother!</b>

00:13:33.350 --> 00:13:34.980
<b>You shouldn't have found out.</b>

00:13:36.940 --> 00:13:38.190
<b>The truth</b>

00:13:39.150 --> 00:13:41.980
<b>is never better than what you hope it is.</b>

00:13:43.150 --> 00:13:45.070
<b>Nevertheless,</b>

00:13:45.150 --> 00:13:46.900
<b>that doesn't change the fact</b>

00:13:46.990 --> 00:13:49.160
<b>that our lives will be spent fighting.</b>

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:53.700
<b>I presume you're ready, Yoh?</b>

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:58.210
<b><i>I see. So they know everything?</i></b>

00:13:58.870 --> 00:14:01.500
<b><i>Very well. Either option is viable.</i></b>

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:04.550
<b><i>Keep taking care
of things on your end. Thank you.</i></b>

00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:07.300
<b>Dear, oh, dear.</b>

00:14:07.380 --> 00:14:08.840
<b>I thought it would hurt her,</b>

00:14:09.430 --> 00:14:12.260
<b>so I didn't tell the girl everything.</b>

00:14:12.970 --> 00:14:14.810
<b>It seems such concerns were unwarranted.</b>

00:14:15.810 --> 00:14:17.430
<b>They're tough kids.</b>

00:14:17.520 --> 00:14:19.100
<b>And our only hope…</b>

00:14:20.440 --> 00:14:24.820
<b>You're just a big softie, Yohmei.</b>

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:26.820
<b>Maybe so.</b>

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:28.950
<b>Now that I think about it,</b>

00:14:29.030 --> 00:14:31.660
<b>the battle had already begun
from that day on.</b>

00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:37.450
<b><i>The day we learned that
he would be reincarnated into this world.</i></b>

00:14:34.190 --> 00:14:36.940
<b>Izumo</b>

00:14:34.190 --> 00:14:36.940
<b>Izumo</b>

00:14:34.190 --> 00:14:36.940
<b>Year</b>

00:14:34.190 --> 00:14:36.940
<b>Year</b>

00:14:46.840 --> 00:14:48.050
<b>He's coming!</b>

00:14:48.130 --> 00:14:50.970
<b>For his next incarnation,</b>

00:14:51.050 --> 00:14:53.800
<b>he's chosen our own flesh and blood!
He will be an Asakura!</b>

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:58.560
<b>You're absolutely certain that this child</b>

00:14:58.640 --> 00:15:00.520
<b>will be him?</b>

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:02.980
<b>I have performed this divination</b>

00:15:03.060 --> 00:15:05.320
<b>countless times before today.</b>

00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:09.280
<b>The result was the same every time!</b>

00:15:09.360 --> 00:15:12.410
<b>Damn you! How dare you
take shelter in our daughter's womb?</b>

00:15:12.490 --> 00:15:15.160
<b>The barefaced audacity!</b>

00:15:15.740 --> 00:15:19.620
<b>The Asakuras have maintained strong
and Furyoku-rich bodies through the ages.</b>

00:15:19.710 --> 00:15:22.290
<b>He must see this
as the most favorable option.</b>

00:15:22.880 --> 00:15:26.000
<b>However,
it's not as if there's nothing we can do.</b>

00:15:26.630 --> 00:15:29.300
<b>I pity poor Keiko, but we have no choice!</b>

00:15:29.880 --> 00:15:34.470
<b>As soon as the child
that his soul inhabits is born,</b>

00:15:34.550 --> 00:15:35.760
<b>I shall kill it!</b>

00:15:37.010 --> 00:15:39.180
<b>So we will have to kill it, after all.</b>

00:15:39.850 --> 00:15:43.400
<b>But what if she's having twins?</b>

00:15:44.900 --> 00:15:46.320
<b>What did you say?</b>

00:15:46.400 --> 00:15:48.070
<b>Two boys.</b>

00:15:48.150 --> 00:15:50.030
<b>If they're identical twins,</b>

00:15:50.650 --> 00:15:52.820
<b>it will be impossible to tell</b>

00:15:52.910 --> 00:15:54.990
<b>which one he is.</b>

00:15:55.070 --> 00:15:59.410
<b>If your divination can establish
whether it will be the child</b>

00:15:59.500 --> 00:16:03.330
<b>who's born first or second,
then it's a different story, though.</b>

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:05.130
<b>Not possible.</b>

00:16:05.710 --> 00:16:08.250
<b>Predicting great flows
of energy is one thing,</b>

00:16:08.340 --> 00:16:11.590
<b>but telling something
like which of the twins will be him</b>

00:16:12.090 --> 00:16:13.220
<b>is just not doable.</b>

00:16:14.220 --> 00:16:15.180
<b>Yohmei.</b>

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:17.550
<b>The choice is yours.</b>

00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:22.560
<b>It doesn't matter.</b>

00:16:23.190 --> 00:16:25.190
<b>I'll kill both of them!</b>

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:29.650
<b><i>How are you feeling?</i></b>

00:16:29.730 --> 00:16:31.490
<b><i>Don't worry about me.</i></b>

00:16:31.570 --> 00:16:34.030
<b><i>It's the babies you're really
concerned about, anyway.</i></b>

00:16:36.030 --> 00:16:37.370
<b>What a shock, though.</b>

00:16:37.950 --> 00:16:40.370
<b>Twin boys? Who would have thought?</b>

00:16:40.650 --> 00:16:44.270
<b>Mikihisa Asakura</b>

00:16:40.650 --> 00:16:44.270
<b>Mikihisa Asakura</b>

00:16:40.650 --> 00:16:44.270
<b>Muko Yo</b>

00:16:40.650 --> 00:16:44.270
<b>Muko Yo</b>

00:16:41.160 --> 00:16:43.910
<b>I'm sure they'll both be fine boys.
How exciting, Keiko!</b>

00:16:44.920 --> 00:16:49.630
<b>As long as they're both healthy,
that's enough.</b>

00:16:45.030 --> 00:16:48.950
<b>Akiko Asakura</b>

00:16:45.030 --> 00:16:48.950
<b>Akiko Asakura</b>

00:16:55.380 --> 00:16:57.430
<b>The labor pains have eased</b>

00:16:57.510 --> 00:16:59.810
<b>and she's getting some sleep, at last.</b>

00:17:00.430 --> 00:17:01.930
<b>Poor girl.</b>

00:17:02.520 --> 00:17:07.060
<b>If only she were in a hospital, she could
be induced to make it all a bit easier.</b>

00:17:07.150 --> 00:17:11.320
<b>But with the crime we're going to commit,
we have no choice but to be here.</b>

00:17:11.400 --> 00:17:13.240
<b>It's the only way.</b>

00:17:13.320 --> 00:17:16.360
<b>The law means nothing
to the man we're dealing with.</b>

00:17:17.360 --> 00:17:20.160
<b>No matter what means we impede him by,</b>

00:17:20.240 --> 00:17:23.450
<b>he simply reincarnates
in someone else's body.</b>

00:17:24.040 --> 00:17:27.080
<b>But if we can kill him now,</b>

00:17:27.170 --> 00:17:29.630
<b>even if he succeeds
in his next reincarnation,</b>

00:17:29.710 --> 00:17:32.550
<b>it will be too late
for the next Shaman Fight.</b>

00:17:33.420 --> 00:17:37.430
<b>I can't think
of any greater pain for a mother,</b>

00:17:37.510 --> 00:17:40.350
<b>but such is the lot of the Asakuras.</b>

00:17:45.270 --> 00:17:48.600
<b>I can't express my gratitude.</b>

00:17:48.690 --> 00:17:52.020
<b>This decision must be
absolutely agonizing for you both.</b>

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:55.690
<b>It's okay with me, Father.</b>

00:17:56.450 --> 00:17:59.110
<b>It's much harder for your daughter.</b>

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:02.450
<b>Ever since I was a little girl,</b>

00:18:02.530 --> 00:18:05.790
<b>I was told all about Asakura Hao.</b>

00:18:06.660 --> 00:18:07.540
<b>That's why,</b>

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:09.670
<b>no matter the cost,</b>

00:18:10.170 --> 00:18:13.590
<b>I cannot allow him to be resurrected.</b>

00:18:14.170 --> 00:18:15.090
<b>Keiko!</b>

00:18:16.260 --> 00:18:19.970
<b>There's nowhere I can run
to escape this fate.</b>

00:18:20.930 --> 00:18:22.550
<b>I have to face it.</b>

00:18:23.890 --> 00:18:25.310
<b>In all honesty,</b>

00:18:25.390 --> 00:18:27.520
<b>I wanted to run away more than anything,</b>

00:18:28.310 --> 00:18:30.980
<b>but I guess I'm an Asakura too.</b>

00:18:31.560 --> 00:18:33.400
<b>You're a good man.</b>

00:18:33.480 --> 00:18:36.990
<b>You're twice the man I ever was…</b>

00:18:38.400 --> 00:18:40.360
<b>Never mind.</b>

00:18:40.450 --> 00:18:42.870
<b>He's nearly here.</b>

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:46.120
<b>Both the Asakuras' progenitor,</b>

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:48.710
<b>and the abominable Great Onmyoji,</b>

00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:50.210
<b>Asakura Hao!</b>

00:18:50.710 --> 00:18:54.800
<b>We may not be able to end
his cycle of rebirth, but…</b>

00:18:57.590 --> 00:19:00.840
<b>As long as the Asakura Family
is in this world,</b>

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:02.470
<b>we will stop your ambitions!</b>

00:19:03.970 --> 00:19:04.810
<b>Shikigami!</b>

00:19:04.890 --> 00:19:07.350
<b>Kill the child!</b>

00:19:09.520 --> 00:19:10.940
<b><i><i>Forgive me,</i></i></b>

00:19:11.020 --> 00:19:12.270
<b><i><i>my grandchild!</i></i></b>

00:19:13.650 --> 00:19:15.320
<b><i>So small.</i></b>

00:19:19.570 --> 00:19:22.410
<b><i><i>It can't be!
He reincarnated with his Spirit Ally?</i></i></b>

00:19:24.370 --> 00:19:25.870
<b><i><i>There's no doubt.</i></i></b>

00:19:25.950 --> 00:19:27.830
<b><i><i>This is the child!</i></i></b>

00:19:27.910 --> 00:19:29.500
<b>Father! Look out!</b>

00:19:30.750 --> 00:19:33.080
<b>Kararincho-kararinsowaka!</b>

00:19:33.580 --> 00:19:35.040
<b>Great Mountain Gods!</b>

00:19:38.630 --> 00:19:39.670
<b>He vanished!</b>

00:19:42.720 --> 00:19:45.930
<b>It'll take more than that to catch me.</b>

00:19:46.640 --> 00:19:50.560
<b>Spirit of Fire's intermediary
is oxygen, after all.</b>

00:19:51.140 --> 00:19:55.230
<b>And oxygen is everywhere,
so it's perfect for reincarnation.</b>

00:19:55.900 --> 00:19:57.230
<b>Having said that,</b>

00:19:57.320 --> 00:20:01.070
<b>reincarnating along with your Spirit Ally
is no mean feat.</b>

00:20:01.150 --> 00:20:04.660
<b>And so Spirit of Fire, who I went
to such great lengths to acquire,</b>

00:20:04.740 --> 00:20:07.410
<b>has almost completely reverted
to his base form!</b>

00:20:10.250 --> 00:20:11.080
<b>It's…</b>

00:20:11.160 --> 00:20:16.080
<b>the Great Onmyoji
who suddenly disappeared 1,000 years ago!</b>

00:20:16.170 --> 00:20:17.790
<b>Asakura Hao!</b>

00:20:19.250 --> 00:20:22.550
<b>You have done a great thing
by giving birth to this child, Keiko.</b>

00:20:23.130 --> 00:20:24.760
<b>-What did you say?</b>

00:20:23.130 --> 00:20:24.760
<b>Don't!</b>

00:20:24.840 --> 00:20:27.050
<b>You still have another child
to give birth to.</b>

00:20:28.260 --> 00:20:29.680
<b>Precisely.</b>

00:20:30.390 --> 00:20:33.640
<b>My precious other half.</b>

00:20:34.940 --> 00:20:38.070
<b>However, that the body
I waited so long for</b>

00:20:38.150 --> 00:20:40.070
<b>turned out to be split into twins</b>

00:20:40.730 --> 00:20:45.110
<b>will no doubt prove to be a trial
for my current incarnation.</b>

00:20:45.910 --> 00:20:50.080
<b>This half of mine will likely
choose to be a king.</b>

00:20:50.660 --> 00:20:52.370
<b>And if he does,</b>

00:20:53.040 --> 00:20:55.500
<b>I'll claim this half of me back.</b>

00:20:55.580 --> 00:20:58.170
<b>Then I will possess even greater power!</b>

00:20:59.500 --> 00:21:02.760
<b>Raise him well.</b>

00:21:04.760 --> 00:21:07.760
<b>I'm sorry. It's all my fault.</b>

00:21:08.350 --> 00:21:11.390
<b>If only I hadn't faltered momentarily,</b>

00:21:11.470 --> 00:21:14.230
<b>things wouldn't be as they are now.</b>

00:21:14.310 --> 00:21:17.060
<b>Please don't apologize, Father.</b>

00:21:17.650 --> 00:21:21.070
<b>All of us here faltered.</b>

00:21:23.740 --> 00:21:26.110
<b>If there really is such a thing as fate,</b>

00:21:26.910 --> 00:21:28.780
<b>I sincerely want to believe in it.</b>

00:21:29.950 --> 00:21:33.950
<b>If you had lost
your humanity back there, Father,</b>

00:21:35.120 --> 00:21:38.540
<b>this child would not be alive now.</b>

00:21:39.920 --> 00:21:41.170
<b>Fate?</b>

00:21:41.960 --> 00:21:45.590
<b>Indeed, it still makes me shudder
to think what would have happened</b>

00:21:45.670 --> 00:21:47.340
<b>had the order been different.</b>

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:51.720
<b>If, as Hao says,
he really is his other half,</b>

00:21:52.470 --> 00:21:56.640
<b>then it's possible he has
the potential to rival Hao's power.</b>

00:21:57.940 --> 00:22:00.270
<b>You cannot escape fate.</b>

00:22:01.110 --> 00:22:04.740
<b>This child will surely suffer,</b>

00:22:04.820 --> 00:22:06.780
<b>but he has no choice but to fight!</b>

00:22:10.660 --> 00:22:14.330
<b><i><i>He is the only hope we have!</i></i></b>

00:22:24.640 --> 00:22:34.690
No matter how ‎‎hard and cruel the dark cave is, I always say your words‎

